      "topic": "Human resources and operating margins",
      "lo": "7.1.7",
      "stem": "An analyst assesses that a company’s new human resources policies will lead to less hiring, increased productivity, and lower costs to train new employees. Based on this assessment, the analyst is most likely to adjust the discounted cash flow valuation model by:",
      "stemZh": "一名分析师判断，某公司的新人力资源政策会带来更少招聘、更高生产率以及更低的新员工培训成本。基于这一判断，分析师最可能通过下列哪项调整 DCF 估值模型？",
