      "topic": "GHG scorecard completeness",
      "lo": "7.1.5",
      "stem": "Research published by the Bank for International Settlements revealed that GHG emissions of borrowing firms have affected bank lending to these firms, but bank-by-bank disparities are high. Based on this information, an analyst is looking to develop a scorecard for three banks by assigning a score on a scale from 1 (poor GHG emission policies and practices) to 5 (strong GHG emission policies and practices). Bank A has a GHG emission policy and reports total GHG emissions/million revenue ($). Bank B does not have a GHG emission policy and reports Scope 1 GHG emissions/million revenue ($). Bank C has a GHG emission policy and reports total GHG emissions/million revenue ($) and Scope 1, 2, and 3 GHG emissions/million revenue ($). Which of the three banks is most likely to receive the highest score?",
      "stemZh": "国际清算银行发布的研究显示，借款企业的温室气体排放影响了银行对这些企业的贷款，但不同银行之间的差异很大。基于这一信息，一名分析师希望为三家银行制定评分卡，评分范围为 1（较差的温室气体排放政策和实践）到 5（较强的温室气体排放政策和实践）。银行 A 有温室气体排放政策，并披露每百万收入（美元）的温室气体总排放量。银行 B 没有温室气体排放政策，并披露每百万收入（美元）的 Scope 1 温室气体排放量。银行 C 有温室气体排放政策，并披露每百万收入（美元）的温室气体总排放量以及 Scope 1、2 和 3 温室气体排放量。三家银行中哪一家最可能获得最高分？",
      "options": [
        {
          "letter": "A",
          "text": "Bank A",
          "zh": "银行 A。"
        },
        {
          "letter": "B",
          "text": "Bank B",
          "zh": "银行 B。"
        },
        {
          "letter": "C",
          "text": "Bank C",
          "zh": "银行 C。"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "explanationEn": "C is correct. Analysts can develop scorecards to assess materiality of different ESG factors for a company and translate qualitative judgments into numerical scores. Bank C has the strongest stance in terms of reporting GHG emissions since it has a GHG emission policy and reports GHG emissions both as total figures and broken down into Scope 1, 2, and 3 emissions.",
      "explanationZh": "C 正确。分析师可以制定评分卡来评估不同 ESG 因素对公司的重大性，并将定性判断转换为数字分数。银行 C 在温室气体排放报告方面立场最强，因为它有温室气体排放政策，并且既报告温室气体总量，也按 Scope 1、2 和 3 排放进行分解报告。",
