      "explanationEn": "A is correct. The effects and benefits of ESG integration into portfolio management are an increasingly wide area of study. Investors typically address the effects to risk-adjusted returns of ESG integration in portfolio management through risk mitigation and alpha generation. Although investors have traditionally used ESG analysis for risk mitigation, many are growing more comfortable with framing ESG analysis as a means to generate alpha.",
      "explanationZh": "A 正确。ESG 整合进入组合管理的影响和收益是一个日益广泛的研究领域。投资者通常通过风险缓释和 alpha 生成来处理 ESG 整合对组合管理中风险调整后收益的影响。虽然投资者传统上使用 ESG 分析进行风险缓释，但越来越多投资者开始更愿意将 ESG 分析表述为一种生成 alpha 的手段。",
