      "topic": "",
      "lo": "",
      "stem": "Which of the following is not an example of greenwashing?",
      "stemZh": "以下哪一项不是 greenwashing 的例子？",
      "options": [
        {
          "letter": "A",
          "text": "A company makes accurate representations of the environmental benefits of its production methods in its regulatory filings.",
          "zh": "公司在监管申报中准确陈述其生产方法的环境收益。"
        },
        {
          "letter": "B",
          "text": "A company represented that its techniques were environmentally friendly and utilized suppliers that produced high volumes of wastewater.",
          "zh": "公司声称其技术环保，但使用会产生大量废水的供应商。"
        },
        {
          "letter": "C",
          "text": "A bank advertised its global financing extended to help its clients transition to net zero and continued to significantly finance investments in businesses and industries that emitted notable levels of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases.",
          "zh": "银行宣传其全球融资用于帮助客户向净零转型，但仍继续大规模融资给排放大量二氧化碳和其他温室气体的企业和行业。"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "explanationEn": "A is correct. The possible categories of misrepresentation include commitments without any guarantees of action, misstatements on product attributes, or misleading disclosures.\nMisstatements on product attributes: A securities class action was filed against a food and beverage company, whereby shareholders claimed that the company had misrepresented the environmental benefits of its production methods in its regulatory filings. The company claimed that its techniques were environmentally friendly, but the claimants argued that, in actual fact, the company’s production processes exhibited almost equivalent greenhouse gas emissions, required similar land usage, and utilized suppliers that produced dangerously high volumes of wastewater.\nMisleading disclosures: The UK advertising watchdog banned the series of HSBC adverts on the grounds of “misleading advertising and environmental claims,” citing HSBC’s failure to acknowledge its own contribution to emissions and said any future campaigns must disclose the bank’s contribution to the climate crisis. Despite the initiatives highlighted in the adverts, HSBC was continuing to significantly finance investments in businesses and industries that emitted notable levels of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases.",
      "explanationZh": "A 正确。可能的误述类别包括没有任何行动保证的承诺、产品属性误述或误导性披露。产品属性误述：针对一家食品饮料公司提起证券集体诉讼，股东声称该公司在监管申报中误述了其生产方法的环境收益。该公司声称其技术环保，但索赔人认为，事实上，该公司的生产过程产生的温室气体排放几乎相当，需要类似的土地使用，并使用产生危险高量废水的供应商。误导性披露：英国广告监管机构以“误导性广告和环境声明”为由禁止了一系列 HSBC 广告，理由是 HSBC 未承认自身对排放的贡献，并表示未来任何宣传活动都必须披露该银行对气候危机的贡献。尽管广告中强调了一些举措，HSBC 仍继续大规模融资给排放显著水平二氧化碳和其他温室气体的企业和行业。",
      "keywordEn": "not an example + accurate representations → not greenwashing",
      "reverseZh": "看到 not an example，反推“准确陈述”不是 greenwashing。",
      "trap": "B 和 C 都是 PDF 解析中的误述/误导性披露案例。",
      "link": "ch09/esg_ch9_three_round_practice.html",
      "hasAnswer": true,
      "knowledgePoint": "Not An Example"
