      "rawText": "Which situation is weak governance?\nA. HR executive in remuneration committee\nB. Remuneration of executive is performance-related\nC. Management remuneration package be aligned to the function or role of manager responsible to their shareholders\nExecutive pay structures aim to align the interests of management with those of the owners, usually by creating a balanced compensation package that includes performance-related remuneration based on short- and long-term goals and with a significant portion of compensation that vests over the long term.\n高管薪酬结构旨在使管理层利益与所有者利益保持一致，通常做法是建立一套平衡的薪酬方案，其中包括基于短期和长期目标的绩效相关薪酬，并让很大一部分薪酬在长期内归属。",
