      "answer": "C",
      "explanationEn": "Different fund managers integrate governance factors into their investment decision-making in different ways. For many, it is a threshold assessment - a formal minimum criterion to consider before they will consider making an investment at any price. Often, it is talked about as quality of management, which, despite the name, is never simply an assessment of the CEO and CFO but, rather, of the overall team and the governance structure by which they oversee the company and (hopefully) drive the success of the business.",
      "explanationZh": "不同基金经理以不同方式将治理因素纳入投资决策。对许多人来说，这是一个门槛评估，即在他们考虑以任何价格投资之前，必须先满足的正式最低标准。它通常被称为管理质量；尽管名称如此，它绝不仅仅是对 CEO 和 CFO 的评估，而是对整体团队及其用于监督公司并有望推动企业成功的治理结构的评估。",
