      "rawText": "Which is collaborative engagement?\nA. Tailored letter\nB. Active public engagement\nC. Follow-on dialogue\nThe others are forms of collaborative engagement (where an institution works with one or more others): 1) informal discussions, 2) collaborative campaigns, 3) follow-on dialogue, 4) soliciting support, 5) group meetings, 6) collective engagement, 7) concert party.\n其他形式属于协作参与沟通（即一家机构与一个或多个其他机构共同开展）：1）非正式讨论；2）协作行动；3）后续跟进对话；4）寻求支持；5）小组会议；6）集体参与沟通；7）一致行动人。",
      "knowledgePoint": "Collaborative Engagement"
