      "rawText": "Which of the following best describes the methodology of a typical ESG strategy index in ETF construction?\nA. Only thematic investing (e.g., focusing on renewable energy)\nB. Solely tilting portfolio weights based on ESG scores\nC. Combining thematic investing with ESG score adjustments\nThese ETFs follow the underlying index or basket construction in a rule-based fashion. These can be thematic - namely, investing only in certain sectors - or tilt weightings based on ESG scores, as described earlier.\n这些 ETF 以规则化方式跟踪底层指数或篮子构建。这些构建可以是主题型的，即只投资于特定行业；也可以如前所述，基于 ESG 分数调整权重。",
