      "explanationEn": " ESG screening - tools that evaluate companies, countries, and bonds based on their exposure or involvement-specific factors, sectors, products, or services.\n Integrated research - Typically sell-side research (investment bank or broker reports) consisting of contextualized, data-informed, analytical opinion designed to support investment decision making.\n Quantitative Analysis - This is primarily data-driven, relying on statistical and mathematical models to analyze data and draw conclusions. It focuses on numerical data, making it a strong fit for a data-based analytical opinion.",
      "explanationZh": "- ESG 筛选：基于公司、国家和债券对特定因素、行业、产品或服务的暴露或参与情况进行评估的工具。\n- 综合研究：通常指卖方研究（投资银行或经纪商报告），由带有背景信息、基于数据的信息化分析意见组成，用于支持投资决策。\n- 定量分析：主要由数据驱动，依靠统计和数学模型分析数据并得出结论。它聚焦数值数据，因此很适合“基于数据的分析意见”这一描述。",
