      "explanationEn": "The following are the first three possible points offered as ways to demonstrate the identification of ESG risk and opportunity  “Examples of where and why the manager is prepared to take either stock or sector ESG risks or where it sees opportunities.  Quantitative or qualitative examples of material ESG factors identified in fundamental analysis and stock valuation.  Identification of long-term ESG secular trends and themes (as potential determinants of future growth or valuation, etc.) and the extent to which they have influenced portfolio construction decisions” (PLSA 2015). In PLSA Stewardship checklist, there are three key requirements. To ensure an effective and meaningful stewardship strategy, investors should do the following: 1) Be clear about how stewardship fits in their investment strategy and policy and how it helps meet their investment objectives. 2) Seek to ensure that fund managers and other service providers deliver effective integration of long-term ESG factors into their investment approach. 3) Work with their advisers to consider the level of resources available for stewardship activities, which assets are covered, and what the appropriate structure is. The disclosure on ESG integration by PLSA asks for separate disclosure on both  identification of ESG risk  the management and monitoring of ESG risks and opportunities, with suggested possible disclosures in respect of each",
      "explanationZh": "以下是用于展示 ESG 风险和机会识别的前三个可能要点： “管理人准备在何处以及为何承担股票或行业 ESG 风险，或在何处看到机会”的示例。 在基本面分析和股票估值中识别重大 ESG 因素的定量或定性示例。 识别长期 ESG 世俗趋势和主题（作为未来增长或估值等的潜在决定因素），以及它们对组合构建决策的影响程度”（PLSA 2015）。在 PLSA 尽责治理清单中，有三项关键要求。为确保有效且有意义的尽责治理策略，投资者应做到以下几点：1）明确尽责治理如何嵌入其投资策略和政策，以及如何帮助实现其投资目标。2）努力确保基金管理人和其他服务提供商在其投资方法中有效整合长期 ESG 因素。3）与顾问合作，考虑可用于尽责治理活动的资源水平、覆盖哪些资产，以及适当的结构是什么。PLSA 关于 ESG 整合的披露要求分别披露以下两项： ESG 风险的识别； ESG 风险和机会的管理与监控，并针对每一项提出可能披露内容的建议。",
